label Initialization
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p s
newton on
special_bonds lj/coul 0 0 0
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
label System_Construction
lattice bcc 3.3 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region whole block 0 66 0 66 0 213 units box
create_box 1 whole
mass 1 92.90637
region target block 0 66 0 66 0 132 units box
region projectile block 0 66 0 66 147 213 units box
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile
group target region target
group projectile region projectile
label Potential
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
label Miscellaneous
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz
velocity all create 300 492845 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
label Production_Run
fix eq all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
unfix eq
velocity projectile add 0 0 -20
fix prod all nve
run 200000
